// Chapter 2, "The Machine." Sources read for this chapter (verified 2026-10-10):
// 14 CFR 91.203, 91.205, 91.207, 91.213, 91.409, 91.411, 91.413, 91.417, 91.9, 47.40, 43.3, Part 43 Appendix A, via the eCFR (current as of 2026-10-07):
//   https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-14/chapter-I/subchapter-F/part-91 (sections above), https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-14/chapter-I/subchapter-C/part-47/subpart-C/section-47.40,
//   https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-14/chapter-I/subchapter-C/part-43 (43.3 and Appendix A)
// Pilot's Handbook of Aeronautical Knowledge, FAA-H-8083-25C, chapters 7 (aircraft systems), 8 (flight instruments), 9 (documents, inspections, inoperative equipment):
//   https://www.faa.gov/regulations_policies/handbooks_manuals/aviation/faa-h-8083-25c.pdf
// Private Pilot Airplane ACS, FAA-S-ACS-6C, tasks PA.I.B and PA.I.G: https://www.faa.gov/training_testing/testing/acs/private_airplane_acs_6.pdf
